 "styleGuide": {
  "path": "Notes/Night Stories/style-guide.md",
  "text": "# Night Stories style guide\n\nHow every video on this channel sounds and looks.\n\n## Voice\n\nCalm and close, like reading by a lamp. Short sentences.\n\n## Words and phrases to avoid\n\n- \"For a while\" as an opener\n- \"Little did they know\"\n\n## Pacing and structure\n\nA cold open under a minute, then chapters of three to five minutes.\n\n## Look\n\nDusk colours, slow camera moves, no fast cuts.\n"
 }
